import lib/cadkernel/acis_append_faceted.dl
import lib/cadkernel/brep_make.dl

function check analytic append {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            ignore @intrinsic("call", "libc", "fflush", an integer, (0 as a pointer))
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "abort", nothing)

set made to the cad cylinder body at (a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 2.0 and z 0.5) with radius 2.0 and height 3.0
check analytic append made's valid
set keys to the cad keys of made's value's coedges
set useNode to the cad node pointer for (the item at 0 in keys) in made's value's coedges
set useNode's pcurve to the cad pcurve of (the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (the cad zero vector2) to (a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 0.0)))
free keys
set documentValue to an empty cad sat document
ignore add cad sat record (a cad sat record numbered -1 of type "seed") to (the address of documentValue)
set written to append cad faceted body made's value to (the address of documentValue)
check analytic append (written's valid and (written's records = 29))
check analytic append ((the length of documentValue's records's values) = 30)
set pcurveCount to 0
loop index from 0 to the length of documentValue's records's values:
    set record to the item at index in documentValue's records's values
    if record's entityType = "pcurve":
        increment pcurveCount
check analytic append (pcurveCount = 1)
print "line_pcurve_written" as a line
